**Phase 2 Acceptance Criteria (Overall):**

*   ✅ All BAML functions (`AnalyzeSingleDocument`, `SynthesizeAllFindings`, `AssessResearchAndPlanNextSteps`, `GenerateFinalLegalReport`) have been tested and refined using inputs characteristic of live data.
